Yeah those might be redundant, I don't see any other engine code explicitly call `_validate_property` in `_get_property_list`. I'm fairly sure that `_validate_property` runs on all properties automatically, including ones added via `_get_property_list`.

Quick test in GDScript to confirm it at least as far as ScriptLanguage is concerned:

```gdscript
@tool
extends Node2D

@export var exportprop: int

func _get_property_list() -> Array[Dictionary]:
	var properties: Array[Dictionary]
	
	properties.append({
		"name": "customprop",
		"type": TYPE_STRING,
	})

	return properties


func _validate_property(property: Dictionary) -> void:
	print(property)
```

